  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa ikawa kwamba huko Gilgali kulikuwa na mtu mmoja mlaghai aitwaye Sheba mwana wa Bikri, Mbenyamini. Basi Sheba alipiga tarumbeta, na kusema,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo, watu wote wa Israeli wakamwacha Daudi, wakamfuata Sheba mwana wa Bikri. Lakini watu wa Yuda walimfuata mfalme Daudi kwa uaminifu toka mto Yordani mpaka mjini Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatimaye, Daudi aliwasili nyumbani kwake mjini Yerusalemu. Mfalme aliwachukua masuria wake kumi ambao alikuwa amewaacha kuangalia nyumba yake, akawaweka kwenye nyumba moja chini ya ulinzi, akawatunza vizuri, lakini hakulala nao. Hivyo, masuria hao wakawa wametiwa ndani hadi siku za kufa kwao, wakaishi kana kwamba, walikuwa wajane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, mfalme akamwambia Amasa, “Nikusanyie watu wote wa Yuda katika siku tatu, na wewe mwenyewe uwepo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Amasa akaenda kuwaita watu wa Yuda. Lakini akachelewa kurudi katika wakati ule aliopangiwa na mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamwambia Abishai, “Sasa, Sheba mwana wa Bikri, atatuletea madhara kuliko Absalomu. Chukua watumishi wangu, umfuatie Sheba asije akaingia kwenye miji yenye ngome akaponyoka, tusimwone tena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai akatoka akiwa pamoja na Yoabu, Wakerethi na Wapelethi pamoja na mashujaa wote. Hao wote waliondoka Yerusalemu kwenda kumfuatia Sheba mwana wa Bikri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walipofika kwenye jiwe kubwa lililoko huko Gibeoni, Amasa akatoka kuwalaki. Yoabu alikuwa amevaa vazi la kijeshi, na ndani ya vazi hilo kulikuwa na mkanda ulioshikilia upanga kiunoni mwake ukiwa kwenye ala yake. Yoabu alipokuwa anakaribia, upanga wake ulichomoka alani ukaanguka chini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akamwambia Amasa, “Je, hujambo ndugu yangu?” Yoabu akamshika Amasa kidevuni kwa mkono wa kulia kana kwamba anataka kumbusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Amasa hakuona upanga uliokuwa mkononi mwa Yoabu. Basi, Yoabu akamchoma Amasa upanga tumboni, matumbo yake yakatoka nje, akafa. Yoabu hakumchoma upanga mara mbili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, Yoabu na nduguye Abishai wakaendelea kumfuatilia Sheba mwana wa Bikri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtu mmoja wa Yoabu akaja akasimama karibu na mwili wa Amasa, akasema, “Yeyote anayempenda Yoabu na yeyote anayempenda Daudi, na amfuate Yoabu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasa alikuwa bado anagagaa kwenye damu yake katikati ya barabara kuu. Kwa hiyo, kila mtu aliyepita hapo, alipomwona, alisimama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kwa hiyo … alisimama:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sehemu imechukuliwa toka mwisho wa aya.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini yule mtu alipoona kwamba watu wote walikuja na kusimama hapo, aliuondoa mwili wa Amasa barabarani, akaupeleka shambani na kuufunika kwa nguo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasa alipoondolewa kwenye barabara kuu, watu wote sasa waliendelea kumfuata Yoabu kumfuatia Sheba mwana wa Bikri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sheba alipitia katika makabila yote ya Israeli mpaka mji wa Abeli wa Beth-maaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "wa Beth-maaka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania: Na Beth-maaka.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Watu wote wa ukoo wa Bikri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bikri:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania: Wabikri.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wakakusanyika na kumfuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wote waliokuwa pamoja na Yoabu wakaenda kumzingira Sheba akiwa katika mji huo wa Abeli wa Beth-maaka. Walirundika kuuzingira mji, na ngome; halafu wakaanza kuubomoa ukuta ili kuuangusha chini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, mwanamke fulani mwenye hekima alisikika kutoka mjini akisema, “Sikieni! Sikieni! Mwambieni Yoabu aje nizungumze naye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akaenda karibu naye, huyo mwanamke akamwambia, “Je, wewe ni Yoabu?” Yoabu akasema, “Naam! Ni mimi.” Yule mwanamke akamwambia, “Nisikilize mimi mtumishi wako.” Yoabu akamwambia, “Nasikiliza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo mwanamke akamwambia, “Hapo kale watu walikuwa wakisema, ‘Waacheni watake shauri kutoka mji wa Abeli’. Ndivyo watu walivyoweza kutatua matatizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi ni mmojawapo wa wale wanaopenda amani na uaminifu katika Israeli. Sasa wewe unakusudia kuuharibu mji ambao ni kama mama katika Israeli. Kwa nini sasa unataka kuuangamiza mji ulio mali yake Mwenyezi-Mungu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akamjibu, “Kamwe maishani mwangu! Sina nia kuangamiza wala kuharibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulivyosema si kweli! Lakini mtu mmoja kutoka sehemu ya milima ya Efraimu aitwaye Sheba mwana wa Bikri anataka kumwasi mfalme Daudi. Mtoeni huyo kwangu nami nitaondoka mjini kwenu.” Yule mwanamke akamwambia Yoabu, “Kichwa chake kitarushwa kwako kupitia ukutani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, huyo mwanamke akaenda kwa watu wote mjini kwa busara yake. Wakamkata kichwa Sheba mwana wa Bikri, wakakitupa nje kwa Yoabu. Kwa hiyo, Yoabu akapiga tarumbeta, na kuwatawanya watu wake kutoka mji huo wa Abeli; kila mtu akaenda nyumbani kwake. Kisha Yoabu akarudi kwa mfalme Daudi, mjini Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa Yoabu alikuwa mkuu wa jeshi lote la Israeli. Benaya, mwana wa Yehoyada, alikuwa mkuu wa Wakerethi na Wapelethi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoramu alikuwa msimamizi wa kazi za kulazimishwa; Yehoshafati alikuwa mwandishi wa kumbukumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
